@startuml FRQ-DRV-16.2-read-sequence
' Putanja čitanja kao interakcija — poziv po pozivu.
' Gledište: izvedba. Publika: implementator.
' Prikaz, ne izvor istine (D-13) — izvor su FRQ-DRV-16.2 §5–§6, temeljni sloj
' (IDriver, GenericDriver.ensure_live, GenericParser.deserialise) i kod blackwattle
' drivers/sdr.py, connections/sdr/connection.py (usklađeno 2026-09-11).
' Teza: tok je ISTI za svaki uređaj; razlika ulazi kroz profil i obiteljski backend.
title FRQ-DRV-16.2 — read path: one implementation for every device

autonumber
skinparam SequenceMessageAlignment center

participant "p :\nSDRReadProcessor" as P
participant "drv :\nDriverSDR" as DRV
participant "cm :\nConnectionManager" as CM
participant "con :\nSDRConnection" as CON
participant "be :\nSDRBackend" as BE
participant "par :\nIQSampleParser" as PAR

P -> DRV : read(uri)
activate DRV
DRV -> DRV : ensure_live() → load()
DRV -> CM : get_connection(connection_name)
CM --> DRV : con
DRV -> CON : ensure_created() — claims the unit if lazy (BR-06)
DRV -> CON : profile: primary format, full scale
DRV -> DRV : block_size × bytes per sample\nmust respect backend.BLOCK_ALIGN
DRV -> PAR : IQSampleParser(format, full_scale)
DRV -> CON : direction is RECEIVE
DRV --> P : generator
deactivate DRV

P -> DRV : next(generator)
activate DRV
DRV -> CON : connect() — stream session
loop over con.schedule(): the tuning plan in turn, or stay where tuned
  opt a plan point
    DRV -> CON : tune(hz)
    alt hz outside every profile range
      CON --> DRV : SDRFrequencyOutOfRange (BR-15) — unit not tuned
    else within range
      CON -> BE : tune(session, hz); read_back(session)
      DRV -> BE : read × settle_blocks — dropped
    end
  end
  loop dwell blocks (for ever without a plan)
    DRV -> BE : read(session, nbytes)
    alt the unit fails
      BE --> DRV : error
      DRV --> P : SDRDeviceLost (BR-09)
    end
    BE --> DRV : bytes
    DRV -> PAR : deserialise(BytesIO(bytes))
    PAR --> DRV : complex64 samples
    DRV --> P : yield SDRSampleBlock(samples, description)
  end
end
note over DRV, CON : the processor closes the generator at its boundary;\nthe session ends, the claim stays with the connection
deactivate DRV

note over P, PAR #E8F5E9
  Description of every block: sequence number, time of first sample (host clock),
  sample count, effective rate and centre frequency read back from the unit,
  format, full scale, losses so far — or None where the mechanism cannot see them.
end note
@enduml
